// Author: russrimm
// Display name: Cloud Flow Activity - Top 20 Most Active Flows
// Description: Highest-volume flows by run count
// Categories: Power Platform
// Resource types: Power Automate
// Topic: Usage Analytics
// Prerequisites: Power Platform admin diagnostic settings connected to Log Analytics workspace

CloudFlowActivity
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize Runs=count(), FailedRuns=countif(ResultStatus == "Failed"), UniqueUsers=dcount(UserId) by FlowDisplayName, FlowId
| extend FailRate=round(todouble(FailedRuns)/todouble(Runs)*100, 1)
| order by Runs desc
| take 20
